# Shop Forge — Section Variant Library Tracker

Goal: ek shared structural library jisse unlimited perceptibly-distinct stores generate hon.
Isko Antigravity bhi update kar sakta hai (repo mein rakho). Umang + Claude source of truth.

---

## Status pipeline (har variant in stages se guzarta hai)

`☐ Spec'd` → `☐ Built` → `☐ Rendered-verified (Umang's eyes)` → `☐ Token-verified (no hardcoded hex)`
→ `☐ Responsive-verified (mobile+desktop)` → `✅ In-library`

**Definition of Done (sab tick hone chahiye variant ko `In-library` bolne se pehle):**
- [ ] Structurally distinct from its siblings (layout-level, cosmetic nahi)
- [ ] Fully token-driven — grep for hardcoded hex/radius = 0
- [ ] Text-on-colored-bg uses `#fff` / `--text-on-accent`, NOT `--surface`
- [ ] Zero fabricated data; trust signals default-hidden
- [ ] Pulls merchant products/images live; neutral fallback for missing assets
- [ ] Responsive both devices; tap targets ok
- [ ] CTA/hierarchy CRO-clean
- [ ] Rendered proof Umang ne khud dekha (viewable link, not local-path screenshot)

